Package: imfwizard
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: ffmpeg, mpv
Description: Interoperable Master Format (IMF) package creator
 IMF Wizard creates valid IMF packages (Interoperable Master Packages)
 from video sources, image sequences, and WAV audio, conforming to
 SMPTE ST 2067 (App#2E).
 .
 Features include JPEG 2000 encoding, HDR/Dolby Vision support,
 multi-language audio with MCA labels, subtitle packaging,
 platform-specific delivery presets (Netflix, Disney+, Amazon, Apple),
 and integrated quality control.
